      "label": "team_0115_nelke_27",
      "hash64": "4DB283DB9882CF62",
      "text": "Mit diesem Kampf wollte ich herausfinden,\\nob du das Zeug dazu hast.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_28",
      "hash64": "4DB286DB9882D47B",
      "text": "Hättest du verloren, wäre es meine Pflicht\\ngewesen, Cassiopeia selbst aufzuhalten.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_29",
      "hash64": "4DB285DB9882D2C8",
      "text": "Aber du bist stark und hast ein großes Herz.\\nDu könntest es tatsächlich schaffen, diesen\\r\\njungen Menschen zu retten.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_30",
      "hash64": "4DAF18DB987FE3BA",
      "text": "Es kratzt an meiner Ehre als Pädagoge, dir solch\\neine schwere Aufgabe aufzubürden, aber...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_31",
      "hash64": "4DAF19DB987FE56D",
      "text": "Bitte besiege Team Stars Big Boss!\\nBesiege Cassiopeia![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0115_select_07",
      "hash64": "A25339232FC8477F",
      "text": "Verstanden, wird gemacht!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0115_select_08",
      "hash64": "A2533E232FC84FFE",
      "text": "Sie können sich auf mich verlassen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_32",
      "hash64": "4DAF16DB987FE054",
      "text": "Vielen Dank. Ich zähle auf dich...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "team_0115_math_01",
      "hash64": "7499F544469AC463",
      "text": "Das ist ja wohl die Höhe![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_33",
      "hash64": "4DAF17DB987FE207",
      "text": "Nanu? Quendella? Wie schön, Sie zu sehen![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "team_0115_math_02",
      "hash64": "7499F644469AC616",
      "text": "Schön ist was anderes![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "team_0115_math_03",
      "hash64": "7499F744469AC7C9",
      "text": "Ich konnte es kaum glauben, als mir zu Ohren\\nkam, dass auf dem Akademiegelände ein\\r\\nunzulässiger Kampf ausgetragen wird![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "team_0115_math_04",
      "hash64": "7499F844469AC97C",
      "text": "Und was finde ich hier vor? Der Direktor\\nhöchstpersönlich tritt gegen [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0405,0000)]eineneine unserer\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0C07,0000)]SchülerSchülerinnen an?![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0405",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0C07",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_34",
      "hash64": "4DAF14DB987FDCEE",
      "text": "Ähm, ich kann das alles erklären...![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "team_0115_math_05",
      "hash64": "7499F944469ACB2F",
      "text": "Ersparen Sie mir Ihre faulen Ausreden, die stinken\\nschlimmer als ein wütendes Skunkapuh![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_35",
      "hash64": "4DAF15DB987FDEA1",
      "text": "St-Stinken...?![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_36",
      "hash64": "4DAF12DB987FD988",
      "text": "Ähem![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_37",
      "hash64": "4DAF13DB987FDB3B",
      "text": "Denk daran: Big Boss wartet nachts auf dem\\nSportplatz auf dich.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_38",
      "hash64": "4DAF10DB987FD622",
      "text": "Bitte kümmere dich um Cassiopeia, ja?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "team_0115_math_06",
      "hash64": "7499FA44469ACCE2",
      "text": "Sie werden nun ein Schreiben aufsetzen, in dem\\nSie sich bei der Schüler- und Lehrerschaft für Ihr\\r\\ntörichtes Verhalten entschuldigen!\\c\\nDie Vorstandsvorsitzende werde ich natürlich\\nauch von diesem Vorfall unterrichten müssen![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 228,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "team_0115_nelke_39",
      "hash64": "4DAF11DB987FD7D5",
      "text": "Ach du liebes bisschen! Alles, nur das nicht,\\nich bitte Sie...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
